#file with 4 fixed co-ordinates, to make sure same size plot every time for mendip map
#input corners.th 

equate 1.0@ReadsGrotto 1.0@Entrance.OldCave.Charterhouse
equate 0@NurseryEntrance.GoughsOld 1.2@LongHole
equate 40@Champions 39@Entrance.GoughsOld

endsurvey

